 style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">period_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rate_code</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rate_code</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">tax_treatment</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">tax_treatment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">tax_amt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">tax_amt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   OR</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">base_amt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">base_amt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>reason_code</code> 是这条查询存在的理由。更正申报在税局侧会留下记录，而<strong>更正原因是判断企业合规意愿的重要信号</strong>：因自身发现而更正、因税局问询而更正、因规则变更而更正，三者含义不同。把原因结构化保存，使得后续同类问题可以被统计与预防，也是第四章第三篇看板的输入之一。</p>\n<h3 id=\"更正的时间边界\">更正的时间边界</h3><p>不是所有错误都能通过更正解决。超出当地规定的更正期限、涉及已注销税号的期次、或者跨境的更正需要他国配合时，路径会变成与税局协商或走专门的救济程序。因此系统在生成更正时应当先做<strong>可行性判断</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>情形</th>\n<th>可否直接更正</th>\n<th>替代路径</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>期内且未超更正期</td>\n<td>可以</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已超当地更正期限</td>\n<td>通常不可</td>\n<td>与税局协商、走评估异议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>涉及已注销税号</td>\n<td>视辖区</td>\n<td>通过代表或原主体处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>涉及跨境分配</td>\n<td>需注册国配合</td>\n<td>通过合作机制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已进入评估程序</td>\n<td>不可自行更正</td>\n<td>在评估程序中主张</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>间接税稽查从外部数据与申报汇总的比对开始，应对的核心是能否把汇总数还原成具体交易。</li>\n<li>需要的证据是&quot;当时的&quot;证据：税号状态、规则版本、消费国判定依据都必须日常积累，事后无法重建。</li>\n<li>差异必须预定义为可归因的类别：前四类（时点、口径、范围、币种）多为解释性，后三类多为实质错误。</li>\n<li>响应管理需要两层时间：税局截止日与内部准备估计，二者冲突时提前升级；范围口径应书面确认。</li>\n<li>日常合规投入（校验留痕、明细清单、内控）有直接经济价值，它影响&quot;过失/故意&quot;的认定与罚则比例。</li>\n<li>更正申报要表达差额与原因；更正前需判断可行性，超期或涉跨境的情形路径不同。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"间接税稽查、评估与补税应对","id":"间接税稽查-评估与补税应对"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：间接税稽查从一次数据比对开始","id":"核心概念-间接税稽查从一次数据比对开始"},{"level":2,"text":"信息请求的响应","id":"信息请求的响应"},{"level":3,"text":"请求的常见形态","id":"请求的常见形态"},{"level":3,"text":"响应的时序管理","id":"响应的时序管理"},{"level":2,"text":"差异的成因分类","id":"差异的成因分类"},{"level":2,"text":"评估与补税决定的形成","id":"评估与补税决定的形成"},{"level":2,"text":"补税与后续更正","id":"补税与后续更正"},{"level":3,"text":"更正的时间边界","id":"更正的时间边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多平台交易数据合并申报","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-indirect-tax-registration-filing/deemed-supplier-input-tax/multichannel-filing-consolidation"},"next":{"title":"税率规则变更的系统跟进（联042）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-indirect-tax-registration-filing/indirect-tax-audit-rule-change/tax-rate-rule-change-sync"}}